      "Q-TEMPO": "Untapped beats enters-tapped; instant beats sorcery for interaction",
      "Q-RATE": "More cards / more mana per mana spent is better",
      "Q-MASS": "Protection for the whole board beats protection for one card",
      "Q-EQUAL": "Functional reprints score the same"
    }
  },
